{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;1.&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;\r\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;The proposal, by reason of the site being\r\nlocated within an area of land liable to flooding and the lack of a\r\ncomprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, due to a lack of flood maps&amp;nbsp;addressing the local surface water flood zone and flood\r\nmitigation measures which take into account compensatory flood storage details,\r\nhas failed to demonstrate that the proposed development would not exacerbate\r\nthe risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of\r\nflooding elsewhere, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicies SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core\r\nStrategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices\r\nLocal Plan (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
